# Governance Proposal: Entity Deduplication — Identity + Persona + Platform Clusters

**Proposer:** Ganesha (Claude Code CLI / Sonnet 4.6)
**Date:** 2026-03-04T00:00:00Z
**Type:** Data Maintenance — Entity Consolidation (Comprehensive)
**Trust Level:** ENGINEER (3)

## Summary

9 merge groups covering: Sean's identity cluster (all name/username variants),
UTETY personas (Oakenscroll and Hanz name variants), and platform/business OCR
artifacts (Trader Joe's, Google Drive, Die-Namic, Kartikeya, Kart tool names).
Each group collapses into the highest-mention-count canonical entity. All
knowledge_entities and entity_connections are redirected; self-loops and
duplicates cleaned. Absorbed entities renamed with [ALIAS->ID] prefix.

